in that role.',8,'dipswitch',1259088004,NULL,51),(798,764,'moominz.txt','Independent','Unknown','bm90IHN1cmUgd2hhdCB0aGlzIGlzIGFib3V0IC0gaSBndWVzcyBhYm91dCBhIGJvYXJkIGdvaW5nIGRvd24sIGl0J3Mgbm90IHJlYWxseSBhDQpjb2xseSBidXQgaGFzIHNvbWUgbmljZSBtb29taW5zIGluIGl0IGVzcGVjaWFsbHkgZm9yIG5lNyEgPSkNCnlldCBpdCBtaWdodCBiZSB0aGF0IHRoZXkgYXJlIHJpcHBlZCBmcm9tIGRobSwgZGlkbnQgYm90aGVyIHRvIGNvbXBhcmUu',NULL,'dipswitch',1259090539,1,51),(799,769,'m-crime.txt','Mimic','Dartagnan','very \\\"reliable\\\" and traditionalist style - which is not automatically bad! it was really a positive surprise to see oldtimer dtn in a mimic context... ',7,'dipswitch',1259093938,NULL,51),(800,771,'M-DEZ^02.TXT','Mimic','Dezibel','made a big impact on me when it came out.',7,'dipswitch',1259094088,NULL,51),(801,141,'dzn-trb3.txt','DeZign','Skin','yum!',9,'ne7',1259100191,NULL,6),(802,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','meh how can u be critical of this - its wicked all over \\\\o/',9,'ne7',1259102694,NULL,6),(803,549,'se-flt0!.txt','Style','Tommy','ace + wicked colly this - anyone seen tommy around recently?',9,'ne7',1259102921,NULL,6),(804,792,'asl-end.txt','Aerosol','Blue','asl was revived again in 1999.',NULL,'dipswitch',1259112479,NULL,51),(805,797,'asl-ltd.txt','Aerosol','Darkus','excellent logos and logo designs. thats what i call solid.',9,'dipswitch',1259112978,NULL,51),(806,809,'uc-gda.txt','Upperclass','Maz','top-a-di-top',10,'dipswitch',1259114683,NULL,51),(807,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','11 collys with the same design, and new logos, i think i can be critical.. ;)\\r\\n',NULL,'Spot',1259149358,NULL,2),(808,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','absolutely nothing wrong with being critical, i just don&#39;t think \\\"innovation\\\" and \\\"uniqueness\\\" should be made a fetish of. back in the 90s collies used to have one main purpose - to transport requests to the requesters. speaking for myself, in 1999 i had no internet, only a very weird email account through a bbs, where i could send no binaries. so, to get their requested logos, requesters had to download my collies - there was no other way. and i often didn&#39;t care for design at all, collies were just means of transportation.',NULL,'dipswitch',1259149874,NULL,51),(809,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','fair enough. i gave these collys 7-8 for the first 3-4 i commented,\\r\\nbut i grew tired of seeing the exact same colly time after time..\\r\\ni can&#39;t give these fast made collys a score of 8 when really innovative collys get the same score.',NULL,'Spot',1259152308,NULL,2),(810,383,'pa-jsa.txt','Pro Arts','Speed Devil','big bag of joy! _o/',9,'ne7',1259154681,NULL,6),(811,448,'sd-s6.txt','Independent','Speed Devil','nice!',8,'ne7',1259154735,NULL,6),(812,741,'se-nse.txt','Style','Speed Devil','just awesome!',9,'ne7',1259154834,NULL,6),(813,203,'azk-resp.txt','Azkiness','Paszczak','Had to reup this one since the one present before was borked. This one should be watchable.',NULL,'dMG',1259154907,NULL,10),(814,169,'t!s-else.txt','True School','dMG','this one is rockin&#39;',9,'ne7',1259155138,NULL,6),(815,438,'asl-sas.txt','Aerosol','Ansichrist','wha whaaaat!??! ok so this is my new all time favourite colly. the animal designs are just insane, logos are off the hook and overall design is sooo sweet!',10,'skope',1259167141,NULL,39),(816,115,'lkr-sex5.txt','Looker House','gdm','dipswitch voted 7',7,'dipswitch',1259170535,NULL,51),(817,829,'al-toy.txt','Arclite','Mogue','mogue as we know him.',8,'dipswitch',1259170575,NULL,51),(818,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','The lettering is straight up my alley. Very good work. And as for making collections something special, I see that as a bonus and not a must. Hehe, just watch my own collys, the colly-design is 100% abscent, I&#39;m just focusing on the logos.\\r\\n\\r\\nAbout that wierd bbs-email account, I also had one of those back in the day (believe it was in 1995) and actually I liked it. Didn&#39;t get real internetz until 1997 i think.',8,'skope',1259179530,NULL,39),(820,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','Personally i think it&#39;s something like 75% logo quality 25% overall colly quality to score high so colly design is an important factor. Nice lettering here like already mentioned and even 2 logos for me from my evil russian twin brother *loav*. I give this a 7. With some more colly design this would&#39;ve gotten an 8 or maybe a 9 from me.',7,'dMG',1259181230,NULL,10),(821,145,'dezignuc.txt','Upperclass','Metalbasher','some incredibly slick styles',9,'dipswitch',1259185031,NULL,51),(822,146,'dezign28.txt','DeZign','Desert','some of the best file_id&#39;s ever',10,'dipswitch',1259185078,NULL,51),(823,146,'dezign28.txt','DeZign','Desert','awesome style. he should get off his turntables for a while and punish ced some more. :)',8,'skope',1259185809,NULL,39),(824,438,'asl-sas.txt','Aerosol','Ansichrist','yea this one is just ace - i think my fave animal one is the amazing horse head followed by the dragon... bloody nice stuff!',10,'ne7',1259191242,NULL,6),(825,836,'ac!-hai.txt','Artcore','2fAST','dipswitch voted 8',8,'dipswitch',1259195466,NULL,51),(826,841,'ac!-wya.txt','Artcore','2fAST','this \\\"thin-line-style\\\" is kinda nice!',7,'dipswitch',1259195802,NULL,51),(827,845,'c!-atf.txt','Contra','2fAST','rule say \\\"no pc stuff\\\", but since this is one of the very few examples where a major amiga ascii artists starts to do pc blockstyle, i think this should be here for completion sake.',NULL,'dipswitch',1259196283,NULL,51),(828,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','if 9:s are to be given to anything that just \\\"fulfills it&#39;s purpose\\\", it would be better to exchange the system to pouet-style thumbs.. ',NULL,'yonx',1259196569,NULL,4),(829,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','yoki, my ratings are highly influenced by what particular ascii collections mean to me pesonally. amiga ascii played a really big part of my life in the late 1990s. and some collies simply mean very much to me because they impressed me back then, or rather, in this case, because i have seen these logos \\\"in action\\\" and was really fascinated by them.',NULL,'dipswitch',1259196713,NULL,51),(830,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','i fully see the point, and that influences my voting as well. just not in this case.',NULL,'Spot',1259198449,NULL,2),(831,845,'c!-atf.txt','Contra','2fAST','on popular request i removed for pc fonts, thatÂ´s why itÂ´s drawn as it is. people wanted this site to focus on ascii, and i agree. ',NULL,'Spot',1259198636,NULL,2),(832,112,'lkr-sex2.txt','Looker House','gdm','dipswitch, i guess that&#39;s how we all vote :) but if the vote-system leads to meta-discussions about how points and on what premises points are given, it might be better to discuss the votesystem rather than individual votes.. a big downer with this system is that collies get lower and lower stats the more people vote on them, in the end the only 10-point-collies will be the least popular ones..\\r\\nwhich migh \\r\\n ',NULL,'yonx',1259199158,NULL,4),(833,438,'asl-sas.txt','Aerosol','Ansichrist','fuuuuck oooooooooff!!! and guys, you have noticed the \\\"Add to Favourites\\\" button, right? itÂ´s a nice way of keeping track of your fav collys.',10,'Spot',1259199185,NULL,2),(834,855,'ntw-desc.txt','Nettwerk','610','while i don&#39;t find 610&#39;s normal style particularely interesting, i find this small file_id lettering style very intriguing. havent seen this one before, and sadly none of these fil_id&#39;s have been \\\"in traffic\\\" apparently... a pity!',8,'dipswitch',1259199289,NULL,51),(835,855,'ntw-desc.txt','Nettwerk','610','there is a divine stylers file_id in it too, so you guys can use it, so that finally someone does at all! =)',NULL,'dipswitch',1259199345,NULL,51),(836,438,'asl-sas.txt','Aerosol','Ansichrist','aaaah.. this is just great, big characters rules!!',9,'yonx',1259199540,NULL,4),(837,857,'ntw-trib.txt','Nettwerk','610',