d to teach me polish when i was 3-4 by reading this book over and over, although it was no success in total, the only polish i know except from the foul language is the lyrics in this book.. i was about to search for the book next week at my mothers place, strange coincidence! 10/10!',10,'yonx',1259322953,NULL,4),(942,1073,'k0-motyw.txt','K0re','Acid','(looks like ansilove is treating it bad though :/ )',NULL,'yonx',1259323242,NULL,4),(943,1073,'k0-motyw.txt','K0re','Acid','yoki, i fear that children&#39;s books are the worst way of learning polish. :) i can speak polish semi-fluently from having studied there, but children&#39;s books are really hard for me to read because of all the wordplay.',NULL,'dipswitch',1259323258,NULL,51),(944,1082,'k0-ninja.txt','K0re','Kempy','this is kempy&#39;s style i really like. and colly design is very neat too.',8,'dipswitch',1259323430,NULL,51),(945,1082,'k0-ninja.txt','K0re','Kempy','after rewatching it with amiga fonts, i mgiht even say that this is one of my favorite polish collies. the ninja divider is so sweet!',NULL,'dipswitch',1259323601,NULL,51),(946,1073,'k0-motyw.txt','K0re','Acid','yeah, but there are good pictures too look at anyway.. i remember the images from \\\"lokomotywa\\\" still today, great stuff! the polax really had nice illustrators/animators over the years, i am collecting polish/russian childrens animations now and some of the stuff is so fucking stylish..',NULL,'yonx',1259323704,NULL,4),(947,1082,'k0-ninja.txt','K0re','Kempy','quite nice one! why are the polish styles so different from the usual ascii? is it because of the mailswapping perhaps? was the polish graffscene also using styles like this in the 90s or is it a pure asciiphenomenon?',7,'yonx',1259323954,NULL,4),(948,1085,'k0-phant.txt','K0re','Kempy','nice preface, which reads like a sort of polish ascii scene manifesto, resulting from the stirr i caused aroud polish asciiscene with TAC back then...\\r\\n\\r\\nthe \\\"engineer with too long coat\\\" characte is so awesome! concerning logo style, i like kempy&#39;s later work far more.',7,'dipswitch',1259324310,NULL,51),(949,1085,'k0-phant.txt','K0re','Kempy','that engineer looks quite similar to Dr.MÃ¼ller in Tintin, haha ',6,'yonx',1259324835,NULL,4),(950,1073,'k0-motyw.txt','K0re','Acid','I dont have the connection you guys have to this. Judging by an artistic and creative view i can go as far as to give this a 7. A weak 7.',7,'dMG',1259332155,NULL,10),(951,1092,'303-ISA.TXT','Independent','Tb-303','i like this one, simple but nice style! however it seems to be a bit broken at places..',7,'yonx',1259424562,NULL,4),(952,1018,'ntw-pcf.txt','Nettwerk','Tb-303','no design but i like it anyway',6,'yonx',1259425046,NULL,4),(953,1092,'303-ISA.TXT','Independent','Tb-303','very very simply style, but somewhat nice. reminds me on big silver bombings.',6,'dipswitch',1259426597,NULL,51),(954,1082,'k0-ninja.txt','K0re','Kempy','fi deh divida ninja!',6,'Spot',1259439164,NULL,2),(955,1098,'art01.txt','Art','Enforcer','C L A S S I C ! \\r\\nS T U F F !\\r\\n\\\\o/',9,'ne7',1259442298,NULL,6),(956,1098,'art01.txt','Art','Enforcer','Classic stuff indeed!\\r\\n',9,'Spot',1259442564,NULL,2),(957,1099,'filed4_rtx.txt','Capital','Rotox','More wicked stuff from Rotox from 93',9,'ne7',1259442732,NULL,6),(958,1110,'acl-btw.txt','Arclite','dHM','Moomin Cleans The Scene; rebellion in Moomin valley... classic :D\r\n\r\n10/10',10,'ne7',1259466060,NULL,6),(959,603,'se-t0!25.txt','Style','Tommy','really awesome collection o/',9,'ne7',1259467639,NULL,6),(960,1110,'acl-btw.txt','Arclite','dHM','haha!',9,'Spot',1259476347,NULL,2),(961,1110,'acl-btw.txt','Arclite','dHM','dipswitch voted 10',10,'dipswitch',1259492949,NULL,51),(962,1110,'acl-btw.txt','Arclite','dHM','I like it. ',7,'ansichrist',1259493390,NULL,53),(963,35,'xcz-aha!.txt','Independent','xClUZiWe','Logos suck, if i have to say something positive, it&#39;s that i liked the bat character.',1,'ansichrist',1259500389,NULL,53),(964,