) ',8,'ne7',1260727498,NULL,6),(1142,1830,'TS-DR245.TXT','Independent','Terminal Silence','ohhhh, some really classic file_id&#39;s in here that i often saw \\\"in traffic\\\"...',8,'dipswitch',1260733080,NULL,51),(1143,1830,'TS-DR245.TXT','Independent','Terminal Silence','indeed! top rankin!',8,'Spot',1260868136,NULL,2),(1144,1233,'-g\'rlpse.asc','G-Style','Danzig','_ _ _________ ______________/\\\\______________\\r\\n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\_ _____//  ____  __   /  __   /\\\\_  ___/\\r\\n    /  \\\\_  \\\\_\\\\   \\\\/   /  _/   /   /_/_ __/__\\r\\n   /  _/   /  \\\\   \\\\__/\\\\___   /  _/   /_/   /\\r\\nDZG\\\\______/_______/\\\\________/_______/_____/ \\r\\n===============/___/===G^STYLE BRINGS YOU===\\r\\nRELAPSE - AN ASCII COLLECTION BY DANZIG/G^S',5,'hAkR!',1260947756,NULL,86),(1145,1233,'-g\'rlpse.asc','G-Style','Danzig','rockin&#39;',8,'ne7',1260980915,NULL,6),(1146,1870,'ne7_hcts.txt','Dual Crew Shining','ne7','i should note the bit on me almost kicking the bucket was written early last year after i was very ill (just in case anyone worries hehe) \\\\o/',NULL,'ne7',1260983785,NULL,6),(1147,1870,'ne7_hcts.txt','Dual Crew Shining','ne7','A nice new collection with some really good logos.',7,'zefyros',1261001651,NULL,61),(1148,1870,'ne7_hcts.txt','Dual Crew Shining','ne7','There&#39;s a couple of these I don&#39;t care for, but for the most part this is freaking awesome, and I have to give mass props for doing &#39;Mandibular Joint Dysfunction&#39; cuz that&#39;s just ... it&#39;s just ... well hell I even messed it up when I did the old version for here  ( colored it wrong )\\r\\n\\r\\n/\\\\/\\\\  \\r\\n\\\\/|>',9,'SGtrUck',1261005373,NULL,67),(1149,275,'h2o!tec5.txt','Fire & Ice','H2o','A very triangular style...\\r\\n\\r\\nalso, released November 21 1993, per my Zenlandia archive. (at least that&#39;s when it got uploaded to Zenlandia, and it had only been to Skullbuggery before that, so it PROBABLY is the 21st of Nov 1993.)  I know I&#39;m being waaay anal about that, I&#39;m not really, I just have dates on this and it&#39;s kina cool (:',8,'SGtrUck',1261064391,NULL,67),(1150,1887,'INT-AP2.TXT','Independent','intruder','[sigh] you know in the states I don&#39;t think we had anyone drawing ascii who had a clue.  I mean look at this, style ... WHAT style, is all over the place... ah well at least my good friend Phideaux! got his SRH a logo in it (:  (Phideaux! if you see this, dammit, ping me.)',1,'SGtrUck',1261065375,NULL,67),(1151,275,'h2o!tec5.txt','Fire & Ice','H2o','you have an old bbs backup from 1993? cool! i envy you! =)',NULL,'dipswitch',1261135422,NULL,51),(1152,1870,'ne7_hcts.txt','Dual Crew Shining','ne7','very hearty collection with some nice stuff in it! the diversity of styles is a bit confusing, but it&#39;s all good - and one can notice that you have been browsing a lot of collies on asciiarena lately. =)',8,'dipswitch',1261135505,NULL,51),(1153,1645,'IHS-HB.TXT','iNhUMaNs','WEDLOCK','too short but very cute!',7,'ne7',1261152476,NULL,6),(1154,95,'dS!-dive.txt','Divine Stylers','dMG','This colly is fucking sick!!!!!',NULL,'Akira',1261170832,NULL,117),(1155,1870,'ne7_hcts.txt','Dual Crew Shining','ne7','i have to agree on the mass style confusion syndrome. browsing the arena for inspiration can only be a good thing though, that brings the scene to higher standards. =)\\r\\n',7,'Spot',1261189198,NULL,2),(1156,826,'al-god.txt','Arclite','Mogue','YWJzb2x1dGVseSBnb2RsaWtlIGxvZ29zLg==',9,'dipswitch',1261528884,1,51),(1157,826,'al-god.txt','Arclite','Mogue','Z29vZCBzdHVmZiBpbmRlZWQh',7,'Spot',1261555768,1,2),(1158,1890,'1oo-corp.txt','1oo%','Neurodancer','aSBoYXZlIHNlZW4gYmV0dGVyIGZyb20gbmV1cm9kYW5jZXIu',6,'Spot',1261556282,1,2),(1159,1891,'se-puri.txt','Style','bOhEmE','TGV0IG1lIGJlIHRoZSBmaXJzdCBvbmUgdG8gY29uZ3JhdHVsYXRlIHlvdSBvbiB0aGlzIHN0ZWFtaW5nIGhvdCBTVFlMRSByZWxlYXNlISBXaWxsIGNoZWNrIGl0IG91dCBub3ch',NULL,'dMG',1261563661,1,10),(1161,1891,'se-puri.txt','Style','bOhEmE','U29saWQgc3R1ZmYuIER1ZSB0byBzaGFtZWxlc