\\/\r\n                                                    .............\r\n\r\n\r\n',0,0),(1278,1094,6,263,'yop','ne7',1285594143,'logos',':D ah that is flipping awesome mate - thanks loads \\o/',0,0),(1279,1094,6,6,'ne7','ne7',1285594199,'ï¿½ï¿½(','i had not seen it - not sure how i missed that :D gonna check the colly out now :)',0,0),(1280,1095,263,154,'rez','yop',1288521060,'razor logo','hey, rez, in my new collection is a razor 1911 logo, i think u are a coder from the razor demo division, when u like it, use the logo for your productions!\r\n\r\n... cy yop',0,0),(1281,1096,296,121,'dARkUS','z!o',1289157050,'old heros club meeting','as it seems, we still have our corners where we meet the boys for a little something. great to finally find my way here. and doing some logos in the background. greetings from the past.\r\n',0,0),(1282,1097,296,2,'Spot','z!o',1289223371,'great thing!','hey spot,\r\n\r\nawesome to finally find this. i am soooo flashed back! great! who else is working on this project? couldn\'t find the credits. also i would like to submit the little honor-logo i did yesterday when i found here. hope you like it and can do something with it?\r\n\r\n\r\n  ascii+    ______  ________ _____ ____ ___     .\r\n   arena   /   _  \\/   ____// ___/_ ___)___)  __|_\r\n    _ __ _/   /    \\___   \\        \\   \\   \\  \\ \\\r\n          \\___\\__ _/____ _/____ ___/__ /___/_ /_/\r\n        . /   _  \\      \\      \\  \\  \\/   _  \\\r\n       _|/   /    \\ | __/_ ____/      \\  /    \\__ ___  _\r\n        :\\___\\____/_|____/___/___\\    /__\\____/\r\n                               z!o\\__/          since 2009\r\n\r\n\r\nso far friendly greetings,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1284,1099,296,51,'dipswitch','z!o',1289223930,'finally again!','hey dip,\r\n\r\nendlich mal wieder wo reingerutscht und dann hier rausgekommen und hocherfreut was hier und auf welche weise abgeht. wenn du zeit hast wuerde ich mich freuen, wenn du mir sagen kannst, welche websites für ascii und amiga-ascii sonst noch am start sind und vor allem ob es the yard, die acidslam, die uphold the law oder sonst noch echte bbs online ist und wie die dns sind. bin ganz heiß, mal wieder mich rumzutreiben, besonders wo der winter ansteht. auch wuerd ich gern meine ascii-sammlung hier stiften. gibt\'s ne etikette für uploading und wer außer spot ist hier im dienst, an den ich mich wenden soll.\r\n\r\nliebe dank schonmal im voraus. und schoen, dasz es dich in dieser welt noch gibt!\r\n\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',0,0),(1285,1100,296,39,'Skope','z!o',1289243686,'participating!','hey skope,\r\n\r\ndont know if you remember me from the time when i was still active in ascii and amigademo scene. yesterday i hit the grounds of asciiarena and i was flashed. and besides that caused by this - its absolutely great work you are doing here - i am already doing logos besides work, i would like to help you with this project here. so i am going to upload my entire colly-collection during the next week to fill the gaps and i would also like to check for whatelse to add to the exsiting data (like groups artists have been in, aliases they used, different tags and stuff like that) but to edit this i have no permission as a user. so this way i am applying for co-sysop position at your great asciiarena. i have been co-sysop wayback for acidslam, uphold the law and a third one i can not recall right now. but ask darkus or spot and many others i have been swapping, trading, doing ascii art with and for in the time from 1998 to 2004.\r\n\r\nregards for your great job here,\r\nand see you soon hopefully,\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',0,0),(1287,1102,296,79,'_10k','z!o',1289256256,'ping...','finally a response...\r\n',1,1),(1288,1103,296,251,'pOGUE','z!o',1289256340,'keep trying...','...to contact you. here now too.',1,1),(1289,1104,296,58,'nUP!','z!o',1289256432,'i dont know...','...if we had contact in the past (ascii or amiga related) or if i just admired your style. friendly greetings anyway.',0,0),(1290,1105,296,281,'SteZotEhiC','z!o',1289256566,'waving','hey stezotehic,\r\n\r\nyou are still one of my (if not THE) ascii-gods. and i do remember we had short contact way back before i left scene. guess it was 2004 or something. also in case you dont remember,\r\n\r\nfriendly greetings,\r\nzito aka marc.\r\n',1,1),(1291,1106,296,62,'kempy','z!o',1289256680,'yeaaaaah!','found you! greetings. hugs & kisses! mate. wow! just found this here, having a two-days-backflash. hoping for a little contact like in the good old days!',0,0),(1292,1107,296,333,'fAr','z!o',1289256786,'greetz!',':-)',0,0),(1293,1108,296,131,'Acid','z!o',1289256838,'fine!','finally i meet you again. i hope so. cause i lost track after your mail and photo websites did not work anymore...\r\n\r\ngreetings,\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',1,1),(1294,1109,296,92,'browallia^nls','z!o',1289256876,'...','pIIIIIIIING!',1,1),(1295,1110,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289260241,'contact','hey zefyros,\r\n\r\nthanks again for the great logos. also i would be interested: are you the only one in your ascii-crew? are you really drawing ascii not before this year. your style looks good and besides some minor stuff it all looks as if you were one of the big guys from the 90s, good old days.\r\n\r\nin any way: greetings,\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',0,0),(1298,1099,296,51,'dipswitch','z!o',1289378169,'~)Ú–\\ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','danke! und weniger stress dir! meld dich wenn der atem reicht...\r\n\r\nliebe grüße.',0,0),(1299,1110,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289378310,'rï¿½ï¿½iï¿½','you sensed it... what do you think about making something together? forming a new ascii-only crew (or reviving off world) and making a colly together one day? well, just late night thoughts...',0,0),(1300,1111,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289476955,'request','hey zef,\r\n\r\ndo you have time & inspiration to creat a big colly logo you do not release yourself before i actually released my little colly in progress? (i just fear you come earlier than me in your high productivity at the moment!)\r\n\r\nwould be nice,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1302,1111,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289482000,'ï¿½ï¿½zï¿½','77x28 maximum oldskool amiga ascii saying \"clean up our closet\" with some nice frames and the bigger letters of you would be nice (also the samurai character from your last colly i really enjoyed) and the question for not releasing it before i release the colly with this name.\r\n\r\nthx.\r\n',0,0),(1304,1112,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289486823,'CleanÂ UpÂ OurÂ Closet','wow, thanks! its great! see it used next week or at least the week afterwards...',0,0),(1305,1113,296,2,'Spot','z!o',1289500971,'issues','hey spot,\r\n\r\nthanks again for doing such a great thing like this! i am very inspired & happy to watch old stuff and drifting into memories... also i like to support, feeling like in the bbs times. pumping & pumping! though i am a quite experienced user (bbs & www) some errors occured while uploading the following files:\r\n\r\nlot-!mot.lha - not appearing at all, though in the list\r\nstarwar4.txt - nothing dl & view\r\nlot-noco.txt - looks bad, not original\r\n\r\nall files in the colly-section.\r\n\r\nhope i did not flood your servers (if this is still possible with ascii theses days) and that you can fix this & tell me what i have done wrong.\r\n\r\nin any way i would like to hear from you, whenever you have time.\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1306,1114,296,2,'Spot','z!o',1289501309,'part2','also realized that some collies are not online although i can not upload them (dupe check says the exist, but they dont) like twisters dzn-24im.txt e.g. !',0,0),(1307,1115,263,213,'Skin/DeZign','yop',1289846426,'hey hoo ...','Nice to see you here! One more of my favourite ascii-oldschooler back in these days! welcome!',0,0),(1309,1116,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1289875737,'and...','...i would like to express the wish to do something together. so if you like... maybe with zeus. the three z\'lers. hehe...',0,0),(1312,1117,32,2,'Spot','zeus',1289940713,'logosubmits','do me a favor and del most of my logosubmits.. loadsa crap/rehearsing in there.\r\ni think this particular one could be the only one to save..\r\n           ______  ____  ______________________  ________________\r\n           \\  _  \\/  __\\_\\_  \\_ \\_ \\  _  \\  _  \\_\\_  \\  _  \\  _  \\ zS!\r\no----------/  /  /___ \\/  /__/  /  /  /  /  /__/  /__/  /  /  /  /-----------o\r\n|:        /     /  /  /  /  /  /  /     /    \\/  ___/  /  /     /           :|\r\n|::..     ¯\\/__/¯\\___/¯\\___/¯\\/¯\\/¯\\/__/¯\\/__/¯\\___/¯\\/__/¯\\/__/         ..::|\r\n}------------------.----------------------------------------------.----------{\r\n| /\\scii/\\rena.com | brought to you by up rough + divine stylers! | (c) 2o1o |\r\n`------------------^----------------------------------------------^----------\'\r\n',0,0),(1316,292,89,13,'zANEr','Daeron',1290047505,'drn!','Hey,\r\n\r\nSorry for getting back this late. I\'ve been struggling with heavy depression for the past years so I\'m not the best reliable person when it comes keeping in touch ;)\r\n\r\nSomeone mentioned this place on Facebook so I decided to come and check it out, but I forgot all about it afterwards. Today there was some talk about the scene and ascii on KG so I remembered this place again. So here I am.\r\n\r\nI do have quite a lot of old, unreleased material and I\'ve been thinking that I might have one or two more collections in me. A place like this might be the perfect to get myself back on track after 11 years between collections :D\r\n\r\nStay in touch.\r\n\r\ndrn!',0,0),(1317,1118,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1290214878,'request','i\'d like to order a logo saying \"good bye!\", \"credits\" or \"history\". thanks!',0,0),(1319,1118,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1290459026,'ï¿½ï¿½zï¿½','wow! great. thank you. i will use the goodbye for the upcoming and the others in the collies afterwards. thanks a lot, man! tell me if you need anything.',0,0),(1320,1119,296,32,'zeus','z!o',1290459229,'urgent request','hey zeus,\r\n\r\ni would be happy about you fullfilling my request for a logo saying \"credits\" or \"history\" to be used in my upcoming colly. thanks in advance.',0,0),(1322,1119,296,32,'zeus','z!o',1290500996,'ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½Þªï¿½','yeah, thanks!',0,0),(1323,1120,296,79,'_10k','z!o',1290501382,'contact','hey there,\r\n\r\nsomehow your name rings a bell, but i dont know where in my head this sound is coming from. guess we were not in contact back in the days. thought you have not been that ascii-genius - neigther am i, dont get me wrong - i liked watching your stuff as each logo had its own style, more like you were painting walls & trains for real. in case you are thinking about a comeback, i would like to invite you to give birth to a new ascii-crew with some other oldskoolers... what do you think?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nzito.\r\n',1,1),(1324,1121,296,218,'macaw','z!o',1290501624,'contact','hey there (third try as spot\'s system sometimes lacks perfection, hehe, so sorry for the lack of inspiration in the text itself),\r\n\r\nsomehow your name rings a bell but i dont know where in my head it is coming from. guess we did not have contact back in the days. though you seem not to be an ascii-genius - neigther am i, dont get me wrong - i enjoyed watching your stuff as every logo was quite unique, more as if you were painting walls & trains for real.\r\nin case you are thinking about a comeback, i would like to invite you togive birth to a new ascii-crew with some other oldskoolers. what do you think?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nzito.\r\n',1,1),(1325,1122,296,251,'pOGUE','z!o',1290502369,'another try','hey poque,\r\n\r\ntried to contact like a thousand times at thuglife.org. hope you are not mad about me. just to let you know, that i am going to finally release our ooooold co-op this week. just in case you still care. thanks a lot for help and tries! and sorry for me always delaying like hell!!!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nzito.\r\n',1,1),(1326,1123,296,79,'_10k','z!o',1290597434,'sorry...','...for the mail the other day. 