f,\r\n\r\ngreat colly. i am amazed! damn, you are like the son of the ascii god. ehrm, something we need to know about your mamma, hehe? ;-)\r\n\r\nbut besides bowing... i\'d like to ask about resistance. ascii-only crew? place left for me to join? would be nice. but dont bother to say no, pal!\r\n\r\nmerry xmas & dont care about misspelling the headline...\r\n\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',0,0),(1393,1161,296,2,'Spot','z!o',1292950008,'sorry an other bug...','when you go to an artists page (e.g. zefyros) and click on the filename of the \"latest release\" besides the diz (in our case \"RSE-xmas.txt\", you get a \"file not found\".\r\n\r\nalso dino did not anwer, but i think i am too lame for dS! anyway. thx.\r\n',0,0),(1394,1162,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1292955286,'new request','i am using your file_id.diz though, so thanks man. also i would like to request a gezeitenreiter logo in the bib blocbuster 3d style of yours with some fancy text box underneath for the official history/release info file. would love it!\r\n\r\nmarc aka zito.\r\n',0,0),(1395,1163,296,6,'ne7','z!o',1292955439,'another try','3rd time, last time. dunno whats wrong with the mail proggy, but i like to request another time - as you last collies were sooo awesome - a 77x28 gezeitenreiter(.de) logo with a frame for text and a gzr.diz for the upcoming release #005 or an unasciied old release. enjoy release #004, also if you want to have a closer look on my ascii-way on other art things. thanks in advance.',0,0),(1397,1163,296,6,'ne7','z!o',1292980412,'jz-ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','thanks. you are doing hot shit, man!',0,0),(1400,1164,190,51,'dipswitch','#MONk!#',1293169648,'mate .. request!!','mate is there anyway you\'d do a :\r\n\r\nASHES TO DUST and an iMPERiAL header for a NFO ? just wondering mate.. .its your old buddy... (as well as zaners) ... Remember you never retired from bk so you have to do this ascii :)\r\n\r\n-mk',0,0),(1401,1165,190,58,'nUP!','#MONk!#',1293169737,'how do i find you ?','hey mate .. p*h* here .