ONk!#',1293420897,'Request!!','Hey mate, you did a couple of requests for me a long time ago. I love your work and would be honored if you could make me a couple of logos.\r\n\r\nI\'m looking for a nfo to be done for iMPERiAL. I\'d like it to look very candy\'ish and happy not all serious and elite looking you know. I thought you\'d be perfect.\r\n\r\nI\'d also like a Bleecker or Bleecker St.\r\n\r\nif you have time a sunos.us & a oneliners. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re really ambitious i\'d love a \"Top Teams!\" \"Top Traders!\" \r\n\r\nIf you\'re really pressed for time and only can do one, please do a Ashes To Dust or Bleecker one.\r\n\r\nThanks mate... I really appreciate it. You\'re one of my favorites, I love seeing your stuff.\r\n\r\n-MONk!^BK-',0,0),(1412,1169,190,121,'dARkUS','#MONk!#',1293421417,'hey mate!!','Hey mate, long time no talk to. You did a bunch of requests for me back for bad karma.. .This is P*hn.... I was hoping you might be able to do a couple of requests for me for old times sake ?\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is what I need. I really hope you can help me.\r\n\r\nBleecker St. \r\nATD\r\nAshes To Dust\r\n\r\nMetro Transit Authority or MTA  -- MTA-NET\r\nConey Island\r\n\r\nand a crypt.pk / en.crypt.pk / de.crypt.pk   if you have time... \r\n\r\nIf you are really ambitious I could really use a iMPERiAL NFO. \r\n\r\nLove you mate, I\'d love to chat w/ you sometime and catch up. I miss our talks!\r\n\r\n-MONk^BK-',0,0),(1413,1170,190,141,'zorro!','#MONk!#',1293421557,'request katty','hey man... heh \r\n\r\ncould you make the following if you have the chance for a old hrlm buddy.\r\n\r\nen.crypt.pk / de.crypt.pk / crypt.pk\r\n\r\nall toys die\r\n\r\nthanks buddy, we still need to talk about some stuff.\r\n\r\npoooty tang!\r\n\r\n-MONk!^BK-',0,0),(1414,1171,190,22,'diNO','#MONk!#',1293428993,'hey matey! anyway you could make time ?','is there anyway you could make time to do a request in your narrow style i love...\r\n\r\n\r\nTotal Fare ? \r\n\r\nIt would be for like a