mber though i\'ve always been pretty inactive. I guess I should do something. \r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know I had been using GRAND CRU for a group name before. Don\'t now if you knew that. i don\'t mind sharing, let me know what you get back for ascii\'s and what you plan to do w/ the name.\r\n\r\np*hn / dalek / #MONk!^BK#',1,1),(1461,1193,190,32,'zeus','#MONk!#',1294137946,'still taking requests ?','Hey mate,\r\n\r\nI really love your style. I wanted to talk to you about helping me do a theme for a place i\'m putting together. Its all subway themed. I really like your style and it fits in w/ some of the other people that are helping.  I really love the 4 characters high  (( [ MYSTIC ] )) (but in ascii of course) stuff you do. Anyway, if nothing else if you could do a couple of these I\'d really appreciate it. These won\'t just go in to the ascii blackhole and never get used. They will be cherished and given a good home.\r\n\r\nMTA \r\n\r\nSubway Line Map\r\n\r\nScribes\r\n\r\nbleecker st. \r\n\r\n6 - Lexington Local Line\r\n\r\nmost importantly since i love your boxes.\r\n\r\nThis will be a statline : Check out what a Metrocard is www.mta.info \r\n\r\nif you could do basically a logo that is a card that says Metrocard but then room in the box for a regular statline stuff =]\r\n\r\nWould be fantastic mate.\r\n\r\nIf you don\'t think you can do it, just let me know, because I don\'t like to request things more than once. I like to use what I get!\r\n\r\nThanks mate,\r\n\r\n#MONk!^BK#',0,0),(1462,1193,32,190,'#MONk!#','zeus',1294155153,'stillÂ takingÂ requestsÂ ?','sounds fab!! i\'ll make time for that during the week.. subway map would be perfect, gotta see how it visualizes.. :)\r\n\r\nbtw, would that place be a ftp site or a bbs?',0,0),(1463,1166,40,190,'#MONk!#','bOhEmE',1294177580,'requestÂ ?','Oh my I\'m getting requests so I guess I need to do a colly at some point :) I can\'t say when you\'ll get your logo but I\'ll send it to you when it\'s done.',0,0),