 ¦            ¯\\_____/¯\\_____/¯\\_____/¯\\_______/¯\\/____/¯\\_____/\r\n     ___   _____________________  ___________________________\r\n    /  /   \\_   \\_      \\  _    \\ \\_         \\  _    \\_      \\  zS!\r\n   /  /____/    /  /    /  /____/ /  /  /    /  /    /  /    /  .\r\n  /  /    /    /  /    /   ____/ /  /  /    /       /  _____/   |\r\n  ¯\\_____/¯\\__/¯\\/____/¯\\_____/  ¯\\/__/____/¯\\/____/¯\\/         ¦\r\n           .                                                    ¦\r\n           |                                        .___________:\r\n           ¦                                        | ____\r\n           :________ __ _   _   _ __ _______________||____|',0,0),(1468,1166,190,40,'bOhEmE','#MONk!#',1294372659,'ï¿½ï¿½zï¿½','In that case I\'ll request more :) \r\n\r\nI\'d love one that says \"Chicken Man\" and Bleecker St. as well.\r\n\r\nTake care mate, and if you want any more requests let me know!! I\'ll cherish them, they really will mean a lot to me to have and they will go to use, they won\'t go to the ascii blackhole that so many requests go to. They will be used over and over again =]\r\n\r\nTake care mate,\r\n\r\n-monk^bk-',0,0),(1469,1194,190,32,'zeus','#MONk!#',1294373378,'thanks for the ascii\'s! and ...','I\'ve just written this message 4 times because for some reason the site doesn\'t recognize your previous subject line when replying =] \r\n\r\nIt is starting out as a site, and then I am going to connect my old /X in to the whole mix of things. I need to get NFS on amigaos working though and a way to parse the files and update the users on the bbs / and all the other txt files it will be interesting to see how it goes together. \r\n\r\nI have been writing scripts so that the site functions more like a bbs. I\'m working on a script that creates a message board, when you cd into a section of the site it will scan for new messages much like /X. I also have written scripts to rotate artwork, much like the multi welcome screen stuff of the past and so-on. \r\n\r\nI\'d really would love the help and think it would be fun to customize w/ a friend.  I don\'t know if you ever have done any color stuff, I always love to see how other people decide on colors and so-on. I\'d really like help coming up w/ a color sceme for it and everything as well. \r\n\r\nWe should talk on irc or something if you would like to have some fun and do this!\r\n\r\n-MONk!^BK-',0,0),(1470,1169,121,190,'#MONk!#','dARkUS',1294417081,'heyÂ mate!!','Hey mate,\r\n\r\nSorry but I havent done any ascii logos in years now and I cant really even remember where the correct keys are :) ... If I do in the future I will do some of those but your probably better asking someone else on here.\r\n\r\nBad Karma still alive then?? What have you been up to over the last few years?\r\n\r\nAll the best,\r\n\r\nLee aka Darkus.',0,0),(1471,1194,32,190,'#MONk!#','zeus',1294425330,'thanksÂ forÂ theÂ ascii\'s!Â andÂ ...','sounds lovely =) busy with heaps of things atm, to the extent that i keep losing sleep.. would appreciate some help over here as well ;) but if that\'s your plan, i might consider doing color versions of the logos some day.. ',0,0),(1472,1194,32,32,'zeus','zeus',1294551194,'ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½^jï¿½\"ï¿½Æ§','http://od.sokeri.com/ascii/linemap.txt',0,0),(1473,1195,190,213,'Skin/DeZign','#MONk!#',1294655823,'years and years ago...','Hey mate,\r\n\r\nYears and years ago you did the design for a bbs in the states called Complex Corrosion. You were on there and we were in contact, I was trying to get a request from you all those years back.  This is kind of embarassing but, you were and still are my favorite artist over all the years. I always thought your style was incredible and clean.  I actually hang out and talk w/ desert here and there. I don\'t know if you\'re going to potentially pick up the keyboard and throw together a couple of logos. If you do, its always been a dream (yes i know, petty pathetic) for you to do a logo for my /X bbs. I am actually putting it back together and going to put it back up online for nostalgia sake. Its winter right now, need to find some things to do inside =]. It really would be a dream come true to have a couple personalized ascii\'s from you if you could make the time. It really would complete a period of time in my life heh.  I remember couriering for WhiteIC and doing favors so I could get a logo from you hehe, I kept his amiga section fast. It was the design ushq for a while.  I always tell desert if he were to run into you irl to bug you to come back and do a couple of logos!\r\n\r\nIt would really mean so much to me mate, and if I can do anything for you in return, just name it and I will do whatever I can to help you out. Its an honor to have you back around. To me you were the best artist of that time. I always loved the sk!n & ambl!n collys.  Someone told me he(amblin) popped his head up somewhere a year or two ago on irc or something, would be neat to see you two do something!\r\n\r\nAnyway, I normally am not so happy to find someone around again, and am normally on the other side of the coin being asked for something etc. Regardless, this made me feel like a teenager again! \r\n\r\nHope to hear from you mate, best of health,\r\n\r\n#MONk!^BK#',0,0),(1474,1196,13,213,'Skin/DeZign','zANEr',1294717305,'hallo nach berlin :)','Hallo sk!n !\r\n\r\nbin ein freund vom Desert, das ist ja cool das du asciiarena gefunden hast :)\r\nwieder lust auf ascii bekommen ? :) hehe\r\n\r\nich hab noch meine bbs laufen falls du mal bock drauf hast zu callen bischen wegen dem flair einfach hehe ...\r\n\r\nsiehste den desert noch öfters? der war länger nich mehr online irgendwie hehe ..\r\n\r\nna dann machs gut, wäre cool wieder asciis von dir zu sehen ;) in der sonst so etwas eingeschlafenen ascii welt ha\r\n\r\nzANEr/dS!',0,0),(1475,1197,13,143,'Mortimer Twang','zANEr',1294717576,'ds!','hey we had this idea of a dS! crew colly\r\n\r\nas me, dmg, trivial, h7, skope and spot would probably already have some recent logos drawn that we could include, maybe 5 of each and then me and dmg will put a design together ;) maybe if i can reach dino before datastorm he can do something too :)\r\n\r\nadios amigo!\r\n\r\nbtw don\'t forget the yard still aliiiive :)\r\n\r\ntoo bad we cant see ya on datastorm, another time we\'ll meet in the up rough city maybe hehe\r\n\r\nzNr',1,1),(1477,1187,159,32,'zeus','Speed Devil',1294846955,'ohÂ andÂ another','Thanks\r\n\r\ndidnt see these until now as i\'ve been away for a while.\r\n\r\nAny particular style you want your reqs in ? since i dont have any style, i just do different stuff everytime i draw which is not often these days.\r\n\r\n',0,0),(1478,1187,32,159,'Speed Devil','zeus',1295008623,'ï¿½ï¿½uï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','noticed some logos you posted on the forum, seems as neat as in stylism6, arid weed logo up front! amazing stuff :O i was actually happy with my new styles until i saw yours.. hehe.. but life goes on.. i\'m not that active either, but logos seem to add up and maybe time for another collection in the coming months. if i\'d come up with a title maybe things would generate their own protocol to push things through. i\'m that optimistic.',0,0),(1479,1142,296,53,'ansichrist','z!o',1295315843,'ï¿½ï¿½zï¿½l','great, yeah!',0,0),(1480,1198,296,2,'Spot','z!o',1295324298,'nobug!','sorry, deleted the topic\'s title formely know as \"mega co-op colly\". sorry! hope you can fix that!\r\n\r\nz.',0,0),(1481,1199,86,61,'zefyros','hAkR!',1295544774,'Resistance Logo done...','   . ____:  _____   _____  ____   _____   __:__   _ .     __    ____:  _____\r\n  _:_\\   !\\_\\    \\__\\  . \\_\\  .:__\\    \\__\\ !  :_: \\:  __:  \\  _\\   !\\_\\  . \\\r\n / !  \\--+---\\ .  \\  \\ :  \\ \\ :|   \\    \\---+--| |  ! /  \\  .\\/  \\--+---\\ :  \\\r\n/  | (_) !_/   :__/ (_)!__/___!!  (_) _./___!__!  --+---  \\ : \\   __!_/   !__/\r\n\\--+---  :\\   _!:_ __--+---   |\\ __    :    :\\  (_) ! \\    \\!  \\ __/:_   _|:_\r