ery stylish. let\'s keep on this!\r\n\r\nfor the nfo, i would do it like this (yes, i am with you with this and i have the same opinion about the idea of nfos as you do!): you make a txt-files as a sketch with all the text/info needed inside, place to hold for the logos etc. and i will check it (my mail is in my profile!) and add some, play around, let ideas come true, then send it back and you continue with new ideas, changing my stuff as you wish and send it back afterwards, i\'ll do the same and we continue until the nfo-sheet is as ready as you like it. and afterwards you gonna make a new colly!!!\r\n\r\nalso i think i did not get all your wishes straight, so a txt-sketch would be needed anyway for me to make \"dropping from the sky\" logos. i can use for you the old triangle style although i promised not to do so. lets see!\r\n\r\nwhat do you think? i like the idea to work on this together with you!\r\n\r\nand i would be interested what you think my new style is! i dont feel like i have one, but maybe there is one coming now we azkee together. and maybe we even gonna do our next colly together?\r\n\r\ngreetz,\r\nzito.\r\n\r\n\r\np.s. if you feel already inspired, i urgently need a aNNo2081 logo (77x28) and a 2081.diz (and if you have the full power a gzr.diz & a gezeitenreiter logo with a frame for text would be nice too!)\r\n\r\np.s. pogue is quite inactive (mails every 4 months i\'d say) so dont expect, but we could let him know about our ongoing idea...\r\n\r\np.s. what\'s the character if not amiga? ibm? arg... what\'s the standard of pc proportional fonts?',0,0),(1560,1232,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1299155138,'request!','dear zefyros,\r\n\r\ni like to request an \"aNNo 2081\" logo and a 2o81.diz! thx.\r\n\r\nz.\r\n',0,0),(1563,1233,296,190,'#MONk!#','z!o',1299349871,'just asking','hey pahn,\r\n\r\nno rush, just wanted to know if you got my last mail concerning our common ascii project. thx!\r\n\r\nz.\r\n',0,0),(1564,1234,61,141,'zorro!','zefyros',1299364145,'