stuff and had been thinking of putting something together. Maybe this would be perfect for both of us !?  You\'ve always been one of my favorite artist, I have been going t hrough every coly you\'ve ever done and picking out some of my favorite logos. \r\n\r\nI started going through all of your collys. I\'m halfway there. Here are my favorites 50% of the way. I thought it may be interesting to you heh. Or maybe not :\r\n\r\nI\'m so impressed w/ the range of your work. Not may other ascii artists have such a range over the years. Even between 1996->1998 there are huge differences in style. Its really fun to watch the progression and then especially in your later years. \r\n\r\nLookerhouse logo from Wild Sytle (1997)\r\nClique logo from Always (1996)\r\nMetal Impact Logo from Always (1996)\r\nValleyofdarkness from indexX  (1998)\r\ndeadontechno logo from indexX  (1998)\r\ndeadontime logo from a little xmas gift (1997)\r\nashes to dust logo from stylism5 :)) (that was for me) I\'ve gotten a few ashes to dust logos done, that is my favorite.\r\nmuse - Murder, death, kill\r\nthebinaryfoundation - Murder,death,kill\r\nEverything in murder,death,kill is excellent and clean..\r\nMogue logo from pointless (1996)\r\nI LOVE \"Sound of Noise\"  logo from pointless ... love this logo. Those  S\'s are awsome.(1996)\r\nBad karma Logo from \"smoke em\" (1996)\r\nElmstreet logo from  \"smoke em\"(1996)\r\nSound of noise logos from \"smoke em\"(1996)\r\nPhuture 303 logo from   ( Though I think the P should be bigger ).\r\nShaolin logo from killer\r\nHard disk cafe logo from killer\r\ndarkman from killer\r\n2nd Sound of Noise (#17) from killer.\r\n--The killer colly is really incredible just because of the amounts of styles... Very impressive.\r\n\r\nI\'ll do the other half tomoorow for yah. Let me know what you think about my proposal. I think between the two of us we could get some really cool guest appearences. It would be fun!\r\n\r\nTake care mate,\r\n\r\n-Luke / #MONk!# aka paHn aka dalek.\r\n\r\n',0,0),(1608,1250,190,58,'nUP!','#MONk!#',1300269360,'hey mate its luke here','Hey,\r\n\r\nI haven\'t been able to get you out of my mind. You and I used to chit-chat every day and now we don\'t even speak :< Zaner showed me a picture from when you all hung out at ds and, I was telling him how close of a friend you were to me and how we would talk just about everything!  I really want to reconnect mate.  Time is too short and, I really miss being your friend. I\'m bugging your mate speedevil to do a colly w/ me. I\'ve been ascii\'ing again. I never put out a colly but, I had drawn since I was young. Then zaner saw a couple of my ascii\'s and said I should really do a colly. Next thing you know i did a couple of requests for zito. So since I love speedevils stuff a lot I told him since he was getting the itch that we should do something together. That made me think of you since him and you are such good mates. Maybe you\'d be down to help and give constructive criticism :) I know you\'re going to hate one of my styles as you generally seem to not give good comments to people who ascii like this, but I also do some very readable stuff too. \r\n\r\nMore than the ascii biz, I just want to have my old friend back and be able to chat about this and that again.\r\n\r\nMissing your company mate,\r\n\r\n-Luke',0,0),(1609,1251,190,58,'nUP!','#MONk!#',1300269520,'last thing.','So i was going through one of your colly\'s because I needed one of the many requests you did for me and I came upon this ascii and I am obsessed w/ it. I can\'t stop thinking how much I like it. Its now my desktop! Some day you have to do something like this for me, i\'m so obsessed w/ it :)) \r\n\r\n                                 _______\r\n                        _____   /   _   \\  _______\r\n              .  ©nUp! /    /__/    /    \\/   _   \\   .\r\n             /l_______/   _/  ·\\    \\    ·\\   /    \\ /l_____ ___ __ _ __ _\r\n_ ___ _ __ __\\___    /    \\  /__\\ ______/__\