ehr gut. \r\n\r\nsag mal du hast doch diese collection of bbs adverts. gibts die noch irgendwo zum download?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n2o!',0,0),(1675,1284,51,141,'zorro!','dipswitch',1301831997,'ï¿½','naja, tac... also, die ersten ausgaben, da bin ich weniger stolz drauf - im nachhinein besehen war es eher eine anmaßung, als kleineer newbie sowas betreiben zu wollen. aber später ist es tatsächlcih ein ganz nettes mag geworden!\r\n\r\neine ganz alte version gibt es hier: http://mbox.bz/slurp/ascii/bbsads/\r\n\r\neine zeit lang hab ich die ads in die bbs-datenbank von pouet.net eingepflegt: http://www.pouet.net/bbses.php\r\n\r\nleider habe ich nicht mehr richtig zeit, um mich drum zu kümmern...',0,0),(1676,1285,141,51,'dipswitch','zorro!',1301833080,'so','ich muss dir ne neue mail schreiben, weil ich auf der alten nicht mehr replie\'n kann. was ich sagen wollte:\r\n\r\ndas hast du schon gut gemacht damals mit tac. die alten leuten haben doch nix auf die reihe bekommen und sich nur in ihrer leet-heit gesuhlt. und heute, im nachhinein, kann man schön tac lesen und ist froh, dass es das damals gab. das passt schon. lieber erstmal machen. es gab ja auch keine echte alternative. \r\n\r\nder mbox link ist super. genau das hab ich gesucht. sehr schön.\r\n\r\nsehr gelacht hab ich auch neulich über dein FAQ in der demogrp-logo collection. ich dachte ihr da drüben auf der legalen seite der dinge habt solche probleme nicht. demoscene respektiert ascii und so. scheint dann aber doch nicht so zu sein. \r\n',0,0),(1677,1285,51,141,'zorro!','dipswitch',1301833542,'so','danke! :)\r\n\r\nzu deiner letzten einschätzung: schön wärs! der demoszene geht ascii eher am arsch vorbei... und der amiga demoszene (bzw den paar leuten, die noch auf dem amiga demos machen) sogar umso mehr. es gibt natürlich schon einen kreis von leuten, die noch wert drauf legen, aber das sind entweder leute, die sich ncoh an bbs-zeiten erinnern können, oder leute die von mir angefixt wurden. :)',0,0),(1678,1285,141,51,'dipswitch','zorro!',1301835096,'ï¿½','das aber schade. ich dachte echt die demoscene\'ler sind die guten. die warezscene hat im moment so einen retroflash und alle wollen os ascii. mal sehen wie lange das noch anhält. ansonsten, wenn du block ascii machst - kannst du dich vor requests kaum retten. \r\n\r\n',0,0),(1679,1249,159,190,'#MONk!#','Speed Devil',1301863062,'requestsÂ andÂ otherÂ stuff.','Hi\r\n\r\nSorry for late answer. I have so much on my mind, taking care of a young child is a fulltime job. I havent talked to franky in years i guess even tho i added him as friend on facebook, should hook up again i guess since i used to hang out with him at the party in denmark during the 90s or talking on the phone alot. Regarding the ascii coop, is it possible that you can show me some of your work? Dont think i have seen it before. Im very thankfull for your compliments as its very inspiring to hear that people like your work and recently i have gotten more good feedback than i ever did back in those days i guess. You have made an extensive list of logos so i have to check that out again as i dont remember them all hehe. I changed style alot since i probably was never 100% happy and i enjoyed trying out new ideas also, more often it didnt work out and ended up in my temp directory. Regarding coop i havent been drawing that much so it would take a while to get enough logos to make up a colly. I would also prefer if i didnt have to do the design as i always hated that, i guess i enjoyed drawing the letters more than design hehe. \r\n\r\nRegard, \r\n\r\nMorten / +sD+',0,0),(1681,1272,296,190,'#MONk!#','z!o',1302044599,'ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','i am not the irc kinda guy. i prefer real life & emails/mails i can check whenever i want and let the process of creative co-working become a free flow. i can not keep on meeting up virtually. sorry pal.',0,0),(1682,1171,190,22,'diNO','#MONk!#',1302088612,'ï¿½ï¿½j×²j|ï¿½k,ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½.ï¿½Ùšï¿½ï¿½bï¿½','oh just so you know this is dalek / pahn from #uprough used to be in up and am getting back involved :)\r\n\r\nanywho if you get a chance... \r\n\r\ni\'m actually doing a colly myself, if there is anything you would like let me know!\r\n\r\ni\'d love if you\'d do a little guest spot. you could just do 1 or 2 logos and it would be like a mini-colly.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to do a colly w/ lots of guest stars..\r\n\r\nIt will have commercial breaks featuring \"DINO^dS!\"\r\n\r\nlogo\r\n\r\nlogo\r\n\r\nback to our program :\r\n\r\nblah blah blah\r\n\r\nblah blah blah\r\n\r\nblah blah blah\r\n\r\nwe interupt your program for an emergency broad cast!!!\r\n\r\ndmg has hacked into the Emergency broadcast network again with :\r\n\r\nlogo \r\n\r\nlogo\r\n\r\nkinda a deal.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you\'d be interested in doing one. i\'m going to get bunch of oldies but goodies to help out!\r\n\r\n#MONk!# aka paHn aka dalek.\r\n\r\n',0,0),(1684,1249,190,159,'Speed Devil','#MONk!#',1302090634,'ï¿½ï¿½zï¿½ljwhï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ÛŸ','Totally understandable. I just found out that I am having another little girl in a few 4 months so, I know exactly what you are going through mate.  I will put together a sample of what I have been working on.  I was thinking of getting a bunch of old mates together and either having little mini-colly\'s inside of one big colly or commercial breaks type of deal and then it could be a couple of logos from speed devil or something for these 3 people.  lots of old timers have been doing a couple logos here or there but, not enough for a whole colly so i thought this up to get some people to work together and maybe get people excited that people are still out there. I\'ll send you a link to some of the stuff i\'ve been working on lately after this message. I totally understand that you wouldn\'t want to agree to work w/ someone when you have no idea if they are any good or hehe.  You put together a bunch of nice logos and some dork throws soem shitty stuff together slaps your name on it and ugh.... I hope you li