 folar,\r\n\r\nin case you need some logo for your upcoming colly, i made you the following.\r\n\r\n                   :                                   :\r\n              _ ___|____________ ______________________| __ _\r\n                   |                                   |  \r\n            _______|   _________ _____       ______    |__________       \r\n          _/      /:_ _\\        |     \\____ /     /____|         /_    \r\n         |  _____/   |  \\_______|______\\   |     /     |    ____/ |  \r\n         |_/_________l__________j  |_______|____/______l___/______|  \r\n                  z!o                                  |nE     \r\n                   |   styLE - wE aRe nEVER oUt oF...  |  \r\n              _ ___|____________ ______________________| __ _\r\n                   |                                   |  \r\n                   :                                   :\r\n\r\ntake off the frame in case you like the logo but naked. and in case you need something else, let me know, i\'d be happy.\r\n\r\nin (the last) case you take requests for the upcoming piece - me impatiently looking expected since your dick-hit! - i\'d have some logos i need. just let me know!\r\n\r\nthanks in advance & thanks for all the asciis you did ever,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1773,1325,296,32,'zeus','z!o',1307324537,'no reqs?','ah, and as you apparently dont know what to draw, i\'d need the following and will use them for sure:\r\n\r\n- 2o81.diz\r\n- aNNo2081 biglogo\r\n- this is gguerilla art #2\r\n- gezeitenreiter(.de)\r\n- gzr.diz\r\n\r\nz. ;-)',0,0),(1774,1326,296,130,'Scour','z!o',1307324652,'sac','hey scour,\r\n\r\ndoes sac officially still exist? and could i join? and would you like to take me as your student in ascii?\r\n\r\ngreetz,\r\nzito.\r\n',1,1),(1777,1327,296,122,'Folar','z!o',1307379442,'lost mail?','great, so here comes an improved version & requests in a hurry!\r\n\r\n                   :                                   :\r\n              _ ___|_____ _______________________ _ ___| __ _\r\n                   |                                   |           .\r\n            _______|     _______ ______      ______    |__________/       \r\n          _/      /:_ ___\\      |      |___ /     /____|         /_    \r\n         |  _____/   |    \\_____|______|   |     /     |    ____/ |  \r\n         | /_________l__________j  l_______|____/______l___/______|  \r\n         |/       z!o                                  |nE     \r\n         :         |  styLE - wE aRE nEVER oUt oF...   |\r\n              _ ___|____________ ______________________| __ _\r\n                   |                                   |  \r\n                   :                                   :\r\n\r\ni do have the same problem with my colly - its 99% finished lieing and waiting. but to continue the chain zeus started: where do you get your requests from these days? seems our skills are not really needed anymore. (anyway, just rememember you are having no requests in the upcoming...)\r\n\r\nin case you get a rush i would like to request the following just fast being sure to like your new style (though no worries if you wanna do some in your olds!) coming up:\r\n\r\n- gezeitenreiter(.de) biglogo with some fancy frames\r\n- gzr.diz\r\n- aNNo2081 biglogo\r\n- 2o81.diz\r\n- \"the trees and i are shaken by the same wind\" colly logo\r\n- wunderwaldradio\r\n- let me know in case you got not enough to do (childcare, wellwell. fresh papa?)\r\n\r\nand thanks for the kind words about my styles.\r\n\r\nregards,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1778,1328,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1307380472,'anything?','in the making, pal? need a job?\r\n\r\nz.',0,0),(1780,1328,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1307381125,'j|ï¿½ï¿½)ï¿½','well, an ascii request. do not have real jobs to offer atm.',0,0),(1781,1329,296,6,'ne7','z!o',1307381181,'another try','hey ne7,\r\n\r\n would like to order some asciis from you. do you take requests?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1783,1329,296,6,'ne7','z!o',1307381437,'jz-ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','in order of needed-rating, do how much you like:\r\n\r\n- 2o81.diz\r\n- aNNo2081 biglogo\r\n- gezeitenreiter(.de) biglogo with frames\r\n- gzr.diz\r\n- wunderwaldradio\r\n- let me know in case you need more!\r\n\r\nthanks in advance,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1785,1330,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1307382951,'anything?','i urgently need an aNNo2081 logo for my upcoming colly. preferable in a big style of yours with 3d. and a releases or release list or even better \"list of releases\" logo with a nice framing underneath for later!',0,0),(1786,1250,58,190,'#MONk!#','nUP!',1307388664,'heyÂ mateÂ itsÂ lukeÂ here','Hi mate! Good to hear from you. I don\'t usually log in when I pop by this site so hadn\'t received any of your messages. Do you hang on #ascii? I\'ll pop by later this week, will have surgery on my leg tomorrow so I\'ll prolly be bedridden for the rest of the week so a lot of time to hang on IRC :)\r\nHow is your ASCII stuff coming along? Would be cool if you two could get a colly together.\r\n\r\nChat with you soon,\r\n-Ilmari\r\n',0,0),(1787,1331,296,32,'zeus','z!o',1307399862,'attempt','did a little remix. (ripp the frame if you need to!)\r\n\r\n                  _______ __________________ ____.___\r\n                 |__|    \\__________________/ /_/|__/\r\n                    :                            !\r\n          _______    ____________    ___________ .   _______\r\n    ______\\      \\__|           /____\\         /____/      /______\r\n   /       \\______  |     _____/  |   \\       /  |  ______/       \\\r\n  /_______________\\_l____/________l____\\_____/___l_/___________z!o_\\\r\n                                       :              \r\n         __ ___ __________________ ____|__        _________\r\n        /__/___|__________________\\_______\\      |_________\\\r\n\r\n\r\nand by that i like to apply for a membership in style. i know we do not know each other well & i might still be a lamer after 10 years asciing, but as i always liked style & anno2081 is going underground soon as it seems, i said to myself, why not try to join one of the most famous ascii crews ever. worst case would be zeus says yes and forces me to develope real style! well...\r\n\r\nregards,\r\nzito.\r\n',0,0),(1791,1327,296,122,'Folar','z!o',1307447292,'ï¿½ï¿½-ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','he, sounds nice. wish i could spend that time with my daugther. for the logos: dont hurry. love your new style, as if i knew.',0,0),(1793,1332,296,61,'zefyros','z!o',1308014241,'thx!','perfect. two in one for me. thanks alot!',0,0),(1794,1333,32,16,'tRiViAL','zeus',1308584489,'REQUEST!','@BEGIN_FILE_ID.DIZ\r\n         __/\\__/¯¯/___  _  ___ ______ zS!\r\no-- --- / /__\\_  __\\_ \\/ \\/  / \\  _  \\--- -\r\n:      /___ \\/  /__/  /  /  /__/  /__/\r\n.     /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /  ___/\r\n¡     ¯\\___/¯\\___/¯\\_  /¯\\___/¯\\___/\r\n`--- - --- --------/__/------------ - -----o\r\n                                           :\r\n      zEUS/sTYLE^mYSTIC >> eVILUTION!      :\r\n                                           !\r\n - -- ---- -------- - -------[xx/xx/2011]--\'\r\n@END_FILE_ID.DIZ\r\n\r\ntitle logo/pic needed! \'\'evilution\'\'! dunno if you\'re around and can make it before end of this month.. would be kewl if done by you, if i need to make up something by myself in a hurry it\'s just no good! :)\r\n\r\nzeusie*',0,0),(1795,1334,296,281,'SteZotEhiC','z!o',1308620841,'application mail','dear stezotehic,\r\n\r\nsome years ago we had some nice e-mails and even longer before i admired you as little ascii dwarf i was. now i do apply for a membership in style. in case you like my style i would be honoured to release upcoming under style as anno2081 is going underground. take 2o81-sRt.txt as an application. if you dont i do get it, i never was fond of me styling dots & lines. thanks for your attention anyway,\r\n\r\nregards,\r\nzito.\r\n',1,1),(1796,1335,296,22,'diNO','z!o',1308620911,'application mail','hello dino,\r\n\r\ni do like to apply for a membership in