ase taging / flagging for download\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nwell i can use alot of bbs design and probraly also for my project.\r\nif you like to do it, the design is all yours!\r\n',0,0),(1846,1350,NULL,121,'dARkUS','Skin',1316372924,'logos','Hi ... \r\nnow some logos for you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n          _______       ___: > Darkus / Aerosol               ______\r\n  _______/      /______/  _|____________ ____. _____._____   /     /__________\r\n_/    ___\\   __/    ____  \\_________   /_    |/     |     \\ /_   _/  ________/__\r\n\\     |/      \\_    |/     |     |/   /_|_   __    /|_     \\_/   \\_____        /\r\n \\_____________/    /______|     /_______/___|/   /   \\___________/   / ______/\r\n           /_______/      |_________\\        /_________\\       /________| skin\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n     :____   ___   ___   ___   _:_   ___   ._______\r\n.____:  _ \\_/ _ \\_/ _ \\_/ | \\_/ | \\_/ _ \\._|_______\\_________.\r\n|o   :  |  |o |  |  |  |  |  |  |: _  |__:                   |\r\n|:   :  |  |: _  |  _  _  _ _|  |o |___  :  Darkus / Aerosol |\r\n|____:  : __  |  _  |  |  |  __ : ___ /  :___________________|\r\n skin:____/|__:__|__:__|__:__|\\___/:\\___/:\r\n     :        :     :     :              :\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n     A          e          r          o          s          o          l\r\n     .          .  ____________       .          .          .          .\r\n     :          :  \\          /   ___ :          :      ___          _.:\r\n _____________  ____\\_____   /___|__ \\______  ______   |   \\______  / |___\r\n \\__   ___    \\/   __   \\/_____    /  \\_    \\/  ___/___|    \\_    \\/     /_____\r\n  /    |/      \\:  ______\\   |/ __/   |/   __\\_______  /    |/    _\\    /|    /\r\n_/     /_____:__| /    :_____|   \\______   \\      ____/\\_____    _|______    /\r\n\\________\\   |_________|  __/       |  \\___/\\______|        \\___/ skin  |___/\r