un of the project is that I sample the old Top of the Pops budget record series for it.\r\n\r\nhttp://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Top_of_the_Pops_%28record_series%29\r\n\r\nhttp://soundcloud.com/sid-juneau/chop-off-the-tops-volume-1\r\n\r\nBtw, do you need any logos atm? I\'m trying to get a collection slowly done with a \"new\" style. Check Devistator\'s latest colly to get an idea.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nzfr',0,0),(1947,1406,151,NULL,'mzta','Hammerfist',1348656737,'FTP Banner','Hi MZTA,\r\n\r\nSorry, I had not seen your request for an FTP banner until now. Are you still interested in one? If so, I\'d like to give it a try for you!\r\n\r\nIf you want me to try, I\'d like to know a couple of things:\r\n- What are the dimensions (in characters) for the banner?\r\n- What platform will it be used for? As in: pc (courier new style font), Amiga (which font? Topaz?), etc.\r\n- Do you want any particular style?\r\n- Will it need to contain specific text/phrases/room for information, etc?\r\n- What\'s your favorite tv-show?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHammerfist/Desire (Or just call me Erwin. Most people do..)',0,0),(1948,1406,NULL,151,'Hammerfist','mzta',1349485799,'FTPÂ Banner','Hi there,\r\n\r\nThanks for interest to take my request, but I already got someone working on it. He is doing the banner only but I still could use site rules art. Would you be willing to help with that?\r\n\r\nIf yes:\r\n\r\n- Width 50-70 characters. Any height, but text area should be adjustable.\r\n- PC.\r\n- Old school, something simple but attractive.\r\n- It should state \"Rules\" somewhere. My site has only one section (MP3).\r\n- I don\'t watch TV :-)\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hear from you.',0,0),(1949,1406,151,NULL,'mzta','Hammerfist',1349634679,'3ï¿½jyï¿½','Hi MZTA,\r\n\r\nSure, I\'ll give it a go. But, ehm, what\'s the site about, what exactly do you mean by the rules? Do you want a piece saying the words \'site rules\' in ascii style, or ascii art to accompany the list of rules? In other words, I need a few more guidelines to know what you expect from me. After that though, the sky\'s the limit ;)',0,0),(1950,1406,151,151,'Hammerfist','Hammerfist',1349634740,'ï¿½<','Also, please contact me on my e-mail, because I respond to that much quicker. Apparently this site doesn\'t have the luxury of e-mail-alerts when someone messages:\r\n\r\nerwinroosjen@gmail.com',0,0),(1951,1394,111,340,'hARPOON','Chrombacher',1349988200,'tjeeeeeeena','Haha.. ja jävlar vilka vackra bilder :-). Måste vara från danmarks-partyt typ 1994.\r\n\r\nI USA, hur hamnar man där? Själv kom jag till Örebro, det fick räcka :)\r\n\r\n//Jonas',0,0),(1952,1394,340,111,'Chrombacher','hARPOON',1350364700,'ï¿½7ï¿½yï¿½ï¿½zv','Kommer bara ihag att det var i en stor idrotts hall och det var massa sno overallt. Ar nog darfor jag sitter med en riktigt stor dun jacka i en av bilderna. \r\n\r\nKom till USA for att plugga i Universitet har och jobbar i San Francisco nu. Orebro ar ju ocksa schysst... tror jag iallafall. Battre ann Arjang dar jag brukade bo haha',0,0),(1953,1407,307,32,'zeus','bRIAN',1350592668,'If I may come with a suggestion','Looking at your logos with the real small font I find myself reading \"P\" when it\'s an \"R\" in the logo over and over. If I may be so bold as to come with a suggestion it would be to let the R design as it is now become \"P\" to have some more details to it and with the option to remove these details for a logo design reason and for R:\r\n   ___\r\n _/_  \\\r\n/  / _/\r\n¯\\/\\_/\r\n\r\nJust my 2c out there, hope you don\'t mind.',0,0),(1954,1400,2,307,'bRIAN','Spot',1350635515,'LOGOEDÂ fail','lugnt, de e fixat. \r\n',0,0),(1955,1407,32,307,'bRIAN','zeus',1350660080,'IfÂ IÂ mayÂ comeÂ withÂ aÂ suggestion','well it\'s contemporary defect i guess, at least when in close comparison with the p letter.... well i fiddled around with it for quite some time way back and alternatives just wouldn\'t fit the picture. futuristic view of the r letter me thinks, in the definition.',0,0),(1956,1408,296,263,'yop','z!o',1350764154,'requeszs','Please draw me a logo for the ultimate bob marley collection and a bob.diz also a gzr.diz and gezeitenreiter.de for upcoming releases. Thx!\r\n\r\nLovelovelove,\r\nz!o.\r\n',0,0),(1957,1132,296,333,'fAr','z!o',1350764270,'ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½ï¿½','Fine lving in the forest most of the time. Being free. And you?',0,0),(1958,1409,296,263,'yop','z!o',1350764532,'requests','Please draw me a gzr.diz a bob.diz and the ultimate bob marley collection. In case u hav time a gezeitenreiter.de would be nice. Thx.\r\n\r\nLovelovelove\r\nz!o.',0,0),(1959,1400,307,2,'Spot','bRIAN',1350833451,',ï¿½7ÚŠ','Försökte ladda upp min första colly på hur länge som helst men det misslyckades under converteringen med en wall-of-fail som inte riktigt sa mig så mycket, är det något du kan hjälpa med?\r\n\r\nhttp://privat.bahnhof.se/wb409723/blandat/Ascii/b^p-fmotp.txt',0,0),(1960,1394,111,340,'hARPOON','Chrombacher',1351505886,'ï¿½,ï¿½','Då har du ungefär samma minnesbilder som jag då :). Måste vart The party. \r\n\r\nÖrebro är väl inte alls så dumt, lagom litet, lagom stort.. för mig iaf. Kanske inte nåt mot SF, men vafan. \r\n\r\nÅrjäng, fan hade för mig att du var från GBG, men minnet från 1994 är väl kanske inte jättebäst :). Jobba i SF låter soft, Java/e^D jobbar också där om jag inte minns fel. ',0,0),(1961,1410,307,104,'Devistator','bRIAN',1351624154,'Doublemorals','I PM you as I don\'t want to hang out others in case it can land them into trouble.\r\n\r\nThe selfvote had nothing to do with ego, or you\'d have seen a vote in my very first comment on the colly.\r\n\r\nWhat happened was I saw zEUS selfvote on his last colly as he have done in the past aswell. When I as a new user see an established artist do that without any bad comments I therefore drew the incorrect conclusion that it was ok to do so and a week after my release when I still lacked a vote for the colly to have a official rating I thought I could vote on it myself without anyone objections.\r\n\r\nObviously I was wrong from the comments I received and I\'ll remember that for later, what I find interesting is however that you have no problem in voting high on zEUS colly not commenting on his selfvote...',0,0),(1962,1411,296,213,'Skin/DeZign','z!o',1352165110,'sitelogo','hey skin, saw you posting a sitelogo which is not displayed due to an issue with your loginname. just send me the logo and i add it!\r\n\r\ncheers.\r\nzito. (co-sysop of asciiarena)',0,0),(1963,1410,104,307,'bRIAN','Devistator',1352193013,'Doublemorals','\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nI noticed Zeus self voted on his earlier colly and to be honest I am over all this fighting for votes so lets just say that this is a lesson learnt for the future.  I personally believe in doing stuff for the sake of the art-form and not for votes, sure its nice to have people acknowledge your hard work but most importantly that you are taking part in some form.  Remember this; the best art you produce will be when you are free from any aim or goal where style just freely flows.\r\n\r\nMany thanks,\r\n\r\nNeil',0,0),(1964,1412,104,51,'dipswitch','Devistator',1352193616,'logo','        ________ _____    ___________\r\n   .____\\ ____  \\\\____)_:_\\_____     \\_  _____ - ----------------------.\r\n   |     \\_  /   \\      |     //______/ /____/                         |\r\n   |_____//______/______|_____|                                        |\r\n      _____                   _______________ _______   _____:_        |\r\n  _:_/ ___/___________/\\_____(____\\.     ._ //  ____/___\\   _|/________:_\r\n \\\\| _______      /  //\\\\          |     |//    \\           \\|_        |/\r\n  /|______|//     \\__//\\\\__________|_____|______//___________//________|\\\\\r\n  (*-- dV$!________\\ --------------------------------------------------\'\r\n\r\nthere you go mate! :D',0,0),(1965,1404,167,141,'zorro!','fum',1353157612,'yo!','Ho lol,\r\nHey Zo what\'s up? I logged in many times since you posted that msg, but it is